+// b2202 AHU (RC X629 AHU1): bit 1 the altar hold's per-altar body pick (econ_altar_hold.cc) also counts living mates I cannot see, at
+// the anchor of their claimed group (claim byte; no claim: skipped), with a stop tool by kit only and the kit's base stats; equal scores
+// go to the lower slot, so out-of-sight holders split over the altars instead of all taking the soonest one.
+#define AHU_BITS 0
+inline const volatile int AHU_TAB[2] = { 0x41485531, AHU_BITS }; // slot 0 magic keeps it out of .bss
